                     |  49%\n  |                                                                            \n  |===================================                                   |  49%\n  |                                                                            \n  |===================================                                   |  50%\n  |                                                                            \n  |===================================                                   |  51%\n  |                                                                            \n  |====================================                                  |  51%\n  |                                                                            \n  |====================================                                  |  52%\n  |                                                                            \n  |=====================================                                 |  52%\n  |                                                                            \n  |=====================================                                 |  53%\n  |                                                                            \n  |=====================================                                 |  54%\n  |                                                                            \n  |======================================                                |  54%\n  |                                                                            \n  |======================================                                |  55%\n  |                                                                            \n  |=======================================                               |  55%\n  |                                                                            \n  |=======================================                               |  56%\n  |                        